        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pey Azhwar\n- Roles: Azhwar saints\n- Organizations: Vaishnava tradition of Hinduism\n- Topics: Hinduism\n- Places: South India, South Asia\n\nFacts:\n- Hinduism is an Indian religion and a way of life that is widely practiced in South Asia.\n- Pey Azhwar, also spelt Peialvar, Peyalvar, or Pei Azhwar, is one of the twelve Azhwar saints of South India.\n- Pey Azhwar is known for affiliation to the Vaishnava tradition of Hinduism.",
